{
  "about": [
    "The parity table between openplate.de and the openplate app (M263 spec 01).",
    "Each expected value was produced by running the app functions once: computeBmrKcal, computeTdeeKcal and suggestDailyKcal in app/models/body-metrics.ts, computeReferenceProteinFloor for the reference protein, and applyEatingStyle with the high-protein style for the high protein figure.",
    "The same file lives in both repositories, byte for byte. Each repository tests its own functions against it, so a constant changed on one side fails that side.",
    "The app takes a birth year, so its test passes birthYear = currentYear - ageYears. A null expected value means the calculator gives no answer for that input."
  ],
